          <div class="question"><b>Q10. Best practice for validation?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="a"> Live check on oninput + Final check on onsubmit</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="b"> Only on submit</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="c"> No check at all</label><label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="d"> Only on page load</label></div>
          <button type="button" class="btn" onclick="checkTest(false)">Submit Test - Check Result</button>
